eras datum raderas permanent på servern. Det går inte att ångra."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All %@ recorded O entries and their dates are permanently deleted on the server. This cannot be undone."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ registrerte O-oppføringer og datoene deres slettes permanent på serveren. Dette kan ikke angres."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ erfassten O-Einträge und ihre Daten werden auf dem Server endgültig gelöscht. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie zapisane wpisy O (%@) wraz z datami zostaną trwale usunięte z serwera. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les %@ entrées O enregistrées et leurs dates seront définitivement supprimées du serveur. Cette action est irréversible."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ geregistreerde O-items en hun datums worden definitief verwijderd op de server. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"기록된 O 항목 %@개와 해당 날짜가 서버에서 영구적으로 삭제됩니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se eliminarán definitivamente del servidor las %@ entradas de O registradas y sus fechas. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todos os %@ registros de O e suas datas serão apagados permanentemente no servidor. Não é possível desfazer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Все записанные O (%@) и их даты будут безвозвратно удалены на сервере. Это действие нельзя отменить."}}}},"hint_all_conditions_below_must_be":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Bedingungen unten müssen zutreffen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aan alle voorwaarden hieronder moet worden voldaan."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"n