n. ▲ ▼ gennemse, ◀ ▶ spol, klik for info og tilstande."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A schermo intero, uno dopo l'altro. ▲ ▼ sfoglia, ◀ ▶ cerca, clic per info e modalità."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全画面で1つずつ表示。▲ ▼ で切り替え、◀ ▶ でシーク、クリックで情報とモード。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Full-screen, one after another. ▲ ▼ browse, ◀ ▶ seek, click for info and modes."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schermvullend, de een na de ander. ▲ ▼ blader, ◀ ▶ zoek, klik voor info en modi."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A pantalla completa, uno tras otro. ▲ ▼ explorar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clic para info y modos."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Na pełnym ekranie, jedna po drugiej. ▲ ▼ przeglądaj, ◀ ▶ przewijaj, kliknij, aby zobaczyć informacje i tryby."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vollbild, eins nach dem anderen. ▲ ▼ blättern, ◀ ▶ spulen, Klick für Infos und Modi."}}}},"hint_generate_heatmaps_and_speeds_for":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generer varmekart og hastigheter for interaktive scener"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"インタラクティブシーンのヒートマップと速度を生成"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generate heatmaps and speeds for interactive scenes"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Generar mapas de calor y velocidades para escenas interactivas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Générer des cartes thermiques et vitesses pour les scènes interactives"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Genereer heatmaps en snelheden voor interactieve scènes"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gerar mapas de calor e velocidades para cenas interativas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Генерация тепловых карт и скоростей для интерактивных сцен"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review",