s_review","value":"Oculto nunca o mostra. Acima de 1× também traz novas cenas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masqué ne l'affiche jamais. Au-delà de 1×, de nouvelles scènes sont aussi proposées."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verborgen toont het nooit. Boven 1× komen er ook nieuwe scènes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gizli, onu hiç göstermez. 1× üzeri yeni sahneler de getirir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“隐藏”表示永不显示。高于 1× 还会带来新的短片。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「已隱藏」表示永不顯示。高於 1× 時也會帶來新短片。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dold visar det aldrig. Över 1× ger också nya scener."}}}},"hint_hidden_never_shows_it_above_1":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“隐藏”表示永不显示。高于 1× 还会带来新的短片。轻扫以移除。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gizli, onu hiç göstermez. 1× üzeri yeni sahneler de getirir. Kaldırmak için kaydır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dold visar det aldrig. Över 1× ger också nya scener. Svep för att ta bort."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「已隱藏」表示永不顯示。高於 1× 時也會帶來新短片。滑動即可移除。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto no lo muestra nunca. Por encima de 1× también trae escenas nuevas. Desliza para quitar."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hidden never shows it. Above 1× also brings new scenes. Swipe to remove."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"«Скрыто» — никогда не показывать. Выше 1× — также приносит новые сцены. Смахните, чтобы удалить."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser det aldrig. Over 1× giver også nye scener. Stryg for at fjerne."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masqué ne l'affiche jamais. Au-delà de 1×, de nouvelles scènes sont aussi proposées. Balayez pour retirer."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgeblendet zeigt es nie. Über 1× bringt auch neue Szenen. Zum Entfernen wischen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"가려짐으로 설정하면 표시되지 않습니다. 1×보다 높으면 새로운 영상도 가져옵니다. 쓸어넘겨 제거하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verborgen toont het nooit. Boven 1× komen er ook nieuwe scènes. Veeg om te verwijderen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「非表示」にすると表示されません。1×より上にすると新しいシーンも表示されます。スワイプで削除。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjult viser den aldri. Over 1× gir også nye scener. Sveip for å fjerne."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryte nigdy się nie pojawia. Powyżej 1× przynosi też nowe sceny. Przesuń, aby usunąć."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculto nunca o mostra. Acima de 1× também traz novas cenas. Deslize para remover."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nascosto non lo mostra mai. Sopra 1× porta anche nuove scene. Scorri per rimuovere."}}}},"hint_hide_sections_you_do_not":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verberg onderdelen die je niet gebruikt. Ze verdwijnen uit de navigatiekolom."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculta las secciones que no uses. Desaparecen de la barra lateral."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjul deler du ikke bruker. De forsvinner fra sidepanelet."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"사용하지 않는 섹션을 가립니다. 사이드바에서 사라집니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hide sections you do not use. They disappear from the sidebar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使わないセクションを非表示にします。サイドバーから消えます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Blende Bereiche aus, die du nicht nutzt. Sie verschwinden aus der Seitenleiste."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjul sektioner, du ikke bruger. De forsvinder fra sidepanelet."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nascondi le sezioni che non usi. Scompaiono dalla barra laterale."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ukryj nieużywane sekcje. Znikną z paska bocznego."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Скройте неиспользуемые разделы. Они исчезнут с боковой панели."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oculte as seções que você não usa. Elas desaparecem da barra lateral."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masquez les sections inutilisées. Elles disparaissent de la barre latérale."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"隐藏你不使用的版块。它们会从边栏中消失。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dölj sektioner du inte använder. De försvinner från sidofältet."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"隱藏你不使用的區段。它們會從側邊欄消失。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kullanmadığın bölümleri gizle. Kenar çubuğundan kaybolurlar."}}}},"hint_host_answered_but_not_as":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主机有响应，但不是 Stash。请检查地址、子路径和自定义标头。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade, men inte som Stash. Kontrollera adress, undersökväg och anpassade headers."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana bilgisayar yanıt verdi, ancak Stash olarak değil. Adresi, alt yolu ve özel başlıkları denetle."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機有回應，但不是 Stash。請檢查位址、子路徑和自訂標頭。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The host answered, but not as Stash. Check the address, subpath and custom headers."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Host odpowiedział, ale nie jako Stash. Sprawdź adres, ścieżkę podrzędną i własne nagłówki."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Værten svarede, men ikke som Stash. Tjek adressen, understien og de brugerdefinerede headers."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'host ha risposto, ma non come Stash. Controlla indirizzo, sottopercorso e header personalizzati."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El host respondió, pero no como Stash. Comprueba la dirección, la subruta y los encabezados personalizados."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホストは応答しましたが、Stashではありません。アドレス、サブパス、カスタムヘッダーを確認してください。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De host antwoordde, maar niet als Stash. Controleer het adres, het subpad en de aangepaste headers."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'hôte a répondu, mais pas en tant que Stash. Vérifiez l'adresse, le sous-chemin et les en-têtes personnalisés."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"호스트가 응답했지만 Stash가 아닙니다. 주소, 하위 경로 및 사용자 지정 헤더를 확인하세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O host respondeu, mas não como Stash. Verifique o endereço, o subcaminho e os cabeçalhos personalizados."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat geantwortet, aber nicht als Stash. Prüfe Adresse, Unterpfad und eigene Header."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte, men ikke som Stash. Sjekk adressen, understien og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Хост ответил, но не как Stash. Проверьте адрес, подпуть и собственные заголовки."}}}},"hint_host_answered_with_web_page":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"호스트가 Stash가 아닌 웹 페이지로 응답했습니다. 로그인 또는 프록시 페이지일 수 있습니다. 주소와 사용자 지정 헤더를 확인하세요."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Хост ответил веб-страницей, а не Stash — вероятно, страницей входа или прокси. Проверьте адрес и собственные заголовки."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホストがStashではなくWebページで応答しました。ログインページまたはプロキシページの可能性があります。アドレスとカスタムヘッダーを確認してください。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Host odpowiedział stroną internetową, a nie jako Stash — prawdopodobnie stroną logowania lub proxy. Sprawdź adres i własne nagłówki."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'host ha risposto con una pagina web, non Stash: probabilmente una pagina di login o di un proxy. Controlla l'indirizzo e gli header personalizzati."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'hôte a répondu avec une page web, pas Stash — probablement une page de connexion ou de proxy. Vérifiez l'adresse et les en-têtes personnalisés."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte med en nettside, ikke Stash – sannsynligvis en innloggings- eller proxyside. Sjekk adressen og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The host answered with a web page, not Stash — likely a login or proxy page. Check the address and custom headers."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Værten svarede med en webside, ikke Stash – sandsynligvis en login- eller proxyside. Tjek adressen og de brugerdefinerede headers."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade med en webbsida, inte Stash – troligen en inloggnings- eller proxysida. Kontrollera adressen och anpassade headers."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El host respondió con una página web, no con Stash; probablemente una página de inicio de sesión o de proxy. Comprueba la dirección y los encabezados personalizados."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O host respondeu com uma página web, não com o Stash — provavelmente uma página de login ou de proxy. Verifique o endereço e os cabeçalhos personalizados."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De host antwoordde met een webpagina, niet met Stash – waarschijnlijk een inlog- of proxypagina. Controleer het adres en de aangepaste headers."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat mit einer Webseite geantwortet, nicht als Stash – vermutlich eine Login- oder Proxy-Seite. Prüfe Adresse und eigene Header."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機回應的是網頁而非 Stash — 可能是登入或代理伺服器頁面。請檢查位址和自訂標頭。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主机返回的是网页而不是 Stash — 可能是登录页或代理页。请检查地址和自定义标头。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana bilgisayar Stash yerine bir web sayfasıyla yanıt verdi — büyük olasılıkla bir giriş veya proxy sayfası. Adresi ve özel başlıkları denetle."}}}},"hint_how_long_scene_has_to":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur länge en scen måste spelas innan den räknas som spelad och positionen sparas."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片須播放多久才會計為已播放並儲存播放位置。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片需要播放多长时间才会计为已播放并存储其播放位置。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bir sahnenin oynatılmış sayılması ve konumunun kaydedilmesi için ne kadar oynaması gerektiği."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor lenge en scene må spilles før den telles som avspilt og posisjonen lagres."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンが再生済みとみなされ、位置が保存されるまでに必要な再生時間です。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Por quanto tempo uma cena precisa ser reproduzida antes de contar como reproduzida e ter sua posição salva."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoe lang een scène moet spelen voordat hij als afgespeeld telt en de positie wordt bewaard."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"영상이 재생한 것으로 계산되고 위치가 저장되기까지 재생해야 하는 시간입니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak długo scena musi być odtwarzana, aby została uznana za odtworzoną i zapisano jej pozycję."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"How long a scene has to play before it counts as played and its position is saved."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor længe en scene skal afspilles, før den tæller som afspillet, og positionen gemmes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сколько должна воспроизводиться сцена, чтобы считаться просмотренной и чтобы ее позиция сохранилась."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Durée de lecture d'une scène avant qu'elle compte comme lue et que sa position soit enregistrée."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto deve durare la riproduzione di una scena prima che conti come riprodotta e la posizione venga salvata."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto tiempo debe reproducirse una escena para contar como reproducida y guardar su posición."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie lange eine Szene laufen muss, bevor sie als gespielt zählt und ihre Position gespeichert wird."}}}},"hint_how_much_each_part_steers":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket varje del styr urvalet."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo każdy element wpływa na wybór."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto ogni parte influisce sulla scelta."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye hver del styrer utvalget."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Насколько каждый фактор влияет на выбор."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cuánto influye cada parte en la selección."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各要素が選択にどの程度影響するかを設定します。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"How much each part steers the picks."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie stark jeder Teil die Auswahl beeinflusst."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dans quelle mesure chaque élément influence la sélection."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value"