o Canales: reproducción continua de un intérprete, estudio, etiqueta o filtro guardado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium-Funktionen, darunter Kanäle – fortlaufende Wiedergabe eines Darstellers, Studios, Tags oder gespeicherten Filters."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Købet afventer – det låses op, når betalingen er gennemført."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zakup oczekuje — zostanie odblokowany po zakończeniu płatności."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Acquisto in sospeso: verrà sbloccato al completamento del pagamento."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aankoop in behandeling – wordt ontgrendeld zodra de betaling is voltooid."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구입 대기 중 — 결제가 완료되면 잠금 해제됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kjøpet venter – det låses opp når betalingen er fullført."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Покупка ожидает — доступ откроется после оплаты."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kauf ausstehend – wird freigeschaltet, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendente — será desbloqueado quando o pagamento for concluído."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendiente: se desbloqueará cuando se complete el pago."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購入は保留中です — 支払いが完了するとロック解除されます。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Satın alma bekliyor — ödeme tamamlanınca kilidi açılır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購買處理中 — 付款完成後即會解鎖。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"购买待处理 — 付款完成后即可解锁。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Köpet väntar – det låses upp när betalningen är klar."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra i Verktyg. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt in Werkzeuge Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ツールで出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other in Tools. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden i Værktøjer. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op in Tools. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Herramientas. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Outils. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в «Инструментах». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Ferramentas. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre i Verktøy. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w Narzędziach. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Strumenti. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other_under":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other under Discover. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Descubrir. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt unter Entdecken Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre under Utforsk. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Descobrir. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「見つける」で出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden under Opdag. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"둘러보기에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Découvrir. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w sekcji Odkrywaj. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в разделе «Открытия». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op onder Ontdek. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Scopri. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“发现”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「探索」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra under Upptäck. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keşfet altında oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}}}},"hint_ranks_your_top_scenes_performers":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangordnar dina främsta scener, stjärnor, studior och taggar i Verktyg, efter mått som O-räknare eller betyg."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中按 O 计数或评分等指标为你的热门短片、演员、工作室和标签排名。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da en iyi sahnelerini, oyuncularını, stüdyolarını ve etiketlerini O Sayısı veya puan gibi ölçülere göre sıralar."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中依 O 計數或評分等指標，為你最常看的短片、演員、工作室和標籤排名。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy w Narzędziach rankingi Twoich najlepszych scen, aktorów, studiów i tagów według miar takich jak licznik O czy ocena."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica suas principais cenas, artistas, estúdios e etiquetas em Ferramentas, por critérios como contagem O ou avaliação."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classe vos meilleurs scènes, performeurs, studios et étiquettes dans Outils, selon des critères comme le compteur O ou la note."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangschikt je topscènes, -performers, -studio's en -labels in Tools, op maatstaven zoals O-teller of beoordeling."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ranks your top scenes, performers, studios and tags in Tools, by measures like O Count or rating."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer de beste scenene, utøverne, studioene og taggene dine i Verktøy, etter mål som O-teller eller vurdering."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oカウントや評価などの指標で、トップのシーン、出演者、スタジオ、タグをツールでランキング表示します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rankt deine Top-Szenen, -Darsteller, -Studios und -Tags in Werkzeuge, nach Maßen wie O-Zähler oder Bewertung."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Составляет в «Инструментах» рейтинги ваших лучших сцен, исполнителей, студий и тегов — по счетчику O, рейтингу и другим показателям."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 O 카운트나 별점 등의 기준으로 상위 영상, 배우, 스튜디오 및 태그의 순위를 매깁니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica le tue scene, performer, studi e tag migliori in Strumenti, per criteri come contatore O o valutazione."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer dine topscener, -kunstnere, -studier og -tags i Værktøjer efter mål som O-tæller eller bedømmelse."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Clasifica tus escenas, intérpretes, estudios y etiquetas favoritos en Herramientas según medidas como el contador O o la valoración."}}}},"hint_ratings_that_were_not_saved":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Avaliações que não foram salvas serão perdidas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les notes non enregistrées sont perdues."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le valutazioni non salvate andranno perse."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bedømmelser, der ikke blev gemt, går tabt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存されていない評価は失われます。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Beoordelingen die niet zijn bewaard, gaan verloren."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Несохраненные рейтинги будут потеряны."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vurderinger som ikke ble lagret, går tapt."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Niezapisane oceny zostaną utracone."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nicht gespeicherte Bewertungen gehen verloren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las valoraciones que no se guardaron se pierden."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장되지 않은 별점은 사라집니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ratings that were not saved are lost."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betyg som inte sparades går förlorade."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未儲存的評分將會遺失。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未存储的评分将会丢失。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kaydedilmeyen puanlar kaybolur."}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_stash_other":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":