n off disappear from the sidebar. Home, Search and Settings always stay."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deler du slår av, forsvinner fra sidepanelet. Hjem, Søk og Innstillinger blir alltid værende."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sektioner, du slår fra, forsvinder fra sidepanelet. Hjem, Søg og Indstillinger bliver altid."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgeschaltete Bereiche verschwinden aus der Seitenleiste. Start, Suche und Einstellungen bleiben immer."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wyłączone sekcje znikają z paska bocznego. Start, Szukaj i Ustawienia zawsze pozostają."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Onderdelen die je uitschakelt, verdwijnen uit de navigatiekolom. Home, Zoek en Instellingen blijven altijd."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"끈 섹션은 사이드바에서 사라집니다. 홈, 검색 및 설정은 항상 남아 있습니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las secciones que desactives desaparecen de la barra lateral. Inicio, Buscar y Ajustes siempre se quedan."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sections désactivées disparaissent de la barre latérale. Accueil, Recherche et Réglages restent toujours."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выключенные разделы исчезают с боковой панели. «Главная», «Поиск» и «Настройки» остаются всегда."}}}},"hint_secure_connection_failed_check_http":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sikker tilkobling mislyktes – sjekk HTTP/HTTPS."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Secure connection failed — check HTTP/HTTPS."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось установить защищенное подключение — проверьте HTTP/HTTPS."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connessione sicura non riuscita: controlla HTTP/HTTPS."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Échec de la connexion sécurisée 